  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "7100b7f9-8b4d-433c-8164-0d80489f0054",
      "question": "In the return-correlation network from June through August 2026, which issuers are the most central, and which pairs moved together most closely?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-02T01:16:49.837691Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-02T01:18:04.765774Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Most central issuers (PageRank centrality in the daily‑return correlation graph, 2026‑06‑01 → 2026‑08‑31)**\n\n| Rank | Issuer (ticker) | Centrality |\n|------|----------------|------------|\n| 1 | PREX | 0.00949 |\n| 2 | SHIE | 0.00692 |\n| 3 | STAS | 0.00687 |\n| 4 | RIOM | 0.00672 |\n| 5 | VIAL | 0.00589 |\n| 6 | GRUA | 0.00577 |\n| 7 | CLEX | 0.00572 |\n| 8 | TISL | 0.00551 |\n| 9 | GRES | 0.00551 |\n| 10 | TOUA | 0.00548 |\n\n**Pairs that moved together most closely (highest absolute return correlation, same window)**\n\n| Rank | Pair (source → target) | Correlation |\n|------|------------------------|-------------|\n| 1 | CLCL → PIAX | 0.8983 |\n| 2 | DROO → PRIX | 0.8826 |\n| 3 | CHOB → CLCL | 0.8732 |\n| 4 | CAED → RIOM | 0.8631 |\n| 5 | BREN → RIOM | 0.8576 |\n| 6 | DROO → RIAH | 0.8559 |\n| 7 | LIOT → RIOM | 0.8551 |\n| 8 | CORK → DROO | 0.8432 |\n| 9 | CLAA → RIOM | 0.8367 |\n| 10 | THII → THST | 0.8332 |\n\n*All figures come from the return‑correlation network built on daily returns from June 1 2026 through August 31 2026 (2000 nodes, 30 128 edges). The centrality scores are PageRank values; the edge correlations are Pearson correlations of daily returns for declared same‑industry peers. Correlation does not imply causation.*\n\n**Source:** market‑analytics `analyze_market_relationships` (top 10 central assets & strongest edges) [1]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — analyze market relationships — evidence `hermes-receipt:95c07cbc2a3ad7a8e842bcfeac2d014fe4d27f311396476d17ca691253be69a7`",
